---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="about">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#070707] text-foreground">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-32 pt-36 md:px-10 md:pt-44">
      <h1 class="mb-16 font-mono text-6xl tracking-loose sm:text-8xl">about</h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-[1.85] text-(--text)/90 md:text-[16px]">
        <p>
          wsg. i've always wanted a space on the internet to put the stuff i make and maintain. 
        </p>

        <img
          src="/images/me-redshirt.jpg"
          alt="Sai in red shirt"
          class="my-12 w-56 border border-(--border)"
        />

        <p>
          in the streets i'm a computer science grad from bits hyd working in
          tech at a startup called <a
            href="https://bayasystems.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-[#ffb52e]"
            >Baya Systems</a>, but in the sheets (as in outside of work), i like doing creative stuff like music, design, film, etc.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
